{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1272.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"818f1146bf085f6696a726fada76bb20e5435aadd26979ab4437125e34ca0659","ja":"……それでね、とってもかわいいネコちゃんのカフェを\n見つけたの。よかったら、この後どうかな？","zh":"……然后呢，我发现了一家猫咪超级可爱的\n猫咪咖啡厅。如果可以的话，待会儿要不要去看看？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1272.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"fddcbc4c53d7b313a6df9b8f92db9585257cd75e11f4472a645474c769c0ee52","ja":"ふふ、大変興味深いですね。ぜひ、\nご一緒させていただければと。麗花はどうでしょう？","zh":"呵呵，真让人感兴趣呢。如果可以的话，\n我很想一同前往。丽花意下如何呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1272.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"fb9ff50b3ec6459e3bc92a795666e6a5382631df0fab4e9773b855e1e2336316","ja":"ふわぁ………………。","zh":"呼啊………………。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1272.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"38cef52a208c2815c8189f9d1189f087333df432d509a28496848dc65f86b47b","ja":"麗花ちゃん？\nどうかしたの……？","zh":"丽花？\n怎么了吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1272.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"10a98cc51381dea55b0ee1dfb6607d3dd087602059d0c2aea59cb9961081d123","ja":"あれ？　ごめんなさい。\nなんだかぼんやりしちゃってたかも。","zh":"哎？对不起。\n我刚才好像有点心不在焉。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1272.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"2ed300606ee5680df840b1c3a2bb5721837f8c2dbd8884d8fce140cecf1660bf","ja":"もしや疲れているのではありませんか？\nそれとも何か、心配事でも？","zh":"难道您感到疲倦了吗？\n还是说，有什么心事呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1272.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"2ee473e1f8640f598c03bf5bb2bd88d0067c5b63e39f337de3d4d3e859f629fc","ja":"そんなことないよ！\nただ、最近ちょっと忙しくって。","zh":"才没那回事呢！\n只是最近稍微有点忙而已。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1272.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"b015e3081b159c4cc64256be761846b2a19c16f8edb975280de6484f6fdbca4e","ja":"この後、ネコカフェに行こうかって\n話してたんだけど……麗花ちゃんは難しそうかな？","zh":"之后我们在说要不要去猫咪咖啡厅……\n丽花可能去不了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1272.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"d5906757051f3bb885b82e8cabb5a1b07f081e57e355782012571069d8527e06","ja":"うーん……とっても行きたいんですけど、\nこのあと大学の飲み会があるんです。　","zh":"嗯……虽然我也很想去，\n不过待会儿大学那边有酒会。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1272.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"3eff97abee1741f1fa52e904f4ceb60c51c17b34be2c2190cb17422938751fca","ja":"だからまた今度、誘ってください！\n明日……はまた飲み会だから、違う日に！","zh":"所以下次一定要再约我哦！\n明天……又要去喝酒，换别天吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1272.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a3079ed78ad291d5e41eeed63ea77929efd9d38e2de788e98fc9498bec2ad7cc","ja":"それじゃあ、お疲れさまでしたー！","zh":"那么，辛苦大家啦——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1272.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"e4b0c0a7480350f029de2c9c88fa269925b4d2abeaaf5c02c3788234cabae70f","ja":"えっ、明日も飲み会！？　本当に大丈夫！？\n……って、行っちゃった。","zh":"诶，明天也有酒会！？真的没问题吗！？\n……走掉了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1272.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"944b18d09dd7c82a5f26ca4ad1822f919f0d5b2b88e1af89da9843018fbe83b7","ja":"そういえば最近、眠そうにしているのを\nよく見かけます。飲み会が続いているのでしょうか？","zh":"说起来，最近经常看到你很困的样子。\n是连续参加酒会了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1272.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"2706c59c87f3cbcb592e9cb5c52ba1254597d6a9c562587b446be90e9a924a07","ja":"そうね……体調を崩さないといいんだけど……。","zh":"也是呢……要是别搞坏身体就好了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
